[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:Where's Sally?]
[00:00.62]Lesson 31 | 第31课
[00:02.58]Where's Sally? | 萨莉在哪儿？
[00:05.02]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答这个问题。
[00:10.79]Is the cat climbing the tree? | 猫在爬树吗？
[00:14.83]Where's Sally, Jack? | 杰克，萨莉在哪儿？
[00:18.32]She's in the garden, Jean. | 她在花园里，琼。
[00:21.07]What's she doing? | 她在做什么？
[00:23.22]She's sitting under the tree. | 她坐在树下。
[00:26.31]Is Tim in the garden, too? | 蒂姆也在花园里吗？
[00:29.67]Yes, he is. | 是的，他在。
[00:31.64]He's climbing the tree. | 他在爬树。
[00:34.24]I beg your pardon? | 请再说一遍？
[00:36.67]Who's climbing the tree? | 谁在爬树？
[00:39.20]Tim is. | 蒂姆在爬。
[00:41.01]What about the dog? | 那狗呢？
[00:43.62]The dog's in the garden, too. | 狗也在花园里。
[00:46.72]It's running across the grass. | 它正在草地上跑。
[00:50.02]It's running after a cat. | 它在追一只猫。